  triage:title "docs/user-documents/tasks.md documents the task commands but omits the C1 rendered example tables that D3 requires" ;
  triage:description "AX.4 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax4-qa-r1, PR #1194 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T09:14Z; found by req-qa ATM-QA-005) at head aaf2e04bf. Sprint AX.4 D3 requires the user document to carry the C1 examples (sprint-AX.4-task-cli-and-docs.md line 65: with the C1 examples); docs/user-documents/tasks.md describes atm send --task-complete and atm list --tasks / --task-events but never reproduces the C1 rendered example tables (TASK_ID/STATE/... and SEQ/AT/EVENT/... headers from code contract C1). Fix: add the C1 example tables to tasks.md, consistent with whichever rendering AX4-QA-005 settles on." ;
